      <title>etch-n-half: Supporting new hardware within stable</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>Debian</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Debian Etch has been released a bit more than a year ago. Since then new hardware has appeared. We are about to release the first real &amp;#34;servicepack&amp;#34; to etch which adds support for e.g. newer graphic cards. This update will also contain other important improvements to stable.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </abstract>
      <description></description>
      <persons>
          <person id="971">Andreas Barth</person>
      </persons>
